{"seq":61,"slug":"linkers-loaders","title":"链接器与加载器","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"链接器与加载器\">链接器与加载器</h1><p>当你敲下 <code>gcc main.c</code> 并看到一个能运行的可执行文件诞生时，编译器只是把每个 <code>.c</code> 翻成了一块块互不相识的机器码碎片。真正把这些碎片缝合成一个能跑的整体、再把它从磁盘搬进内存、让 CPU 找到第一条指令的，是两个长期隐身于幕后的角色：链接器与加载器。它们既不出现在大多数教程的目录里，也很少在面试题之外被认真讨论，却是「源码如何变成进程」这条因果链上不可绕过的一环。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 把这条因果链完整摊开，分四章层层递进。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」铺设地基：先建立从预处理、编译、汇编到链接、装载的全景视图，弄清编译器与链接器的分工边界；再深入目标文件这一核心数据结构，对照 ELF、PE、Mach-O 三大格式；最后讲透符号与重定位——链接器赖以工作的两块基石。没有这三块地基，后面的一切都无从谈起。</p>\n<p>第二章「链接」聚焦静态链接：多个目标文件和静态库如何被拼装成一个完整的可执行体。这里会讲静态库 <code>.a</code> 的本质、链接器扫描归档时那条让无数人栽跟头的「库顺序」规则、以及节与段如何被合并、排布到最终的内存布局里。</p>\n<p>第三章「动态链接」转向运行期：共享库为什么能省内存、能热更新；PLT 与 GOT 这对机制如何实现函数调用的延迟绑定；以及动态链接器在进程启动时和 <code>dlopen</code> 调用时分别做了什么。静态链接把一切定死在构建期，动态链接则把决策推迟到加载乃至运行的那一刻——理解这种推迟，是理解现代软件分发的关键。</p>\n<p>第四章「进阶」收口：链接时优化 LTO 如何打破编译单元的边界做全程序优化；位置无关代码与 ASLR 如何在安全与性能之间权衡；以及当链接真的出错时，怎样系统化地排查那些令人头大的「undefined reference」与「symbol not found」。</p>\n<p>四章读下来，你将不再把链接器当成一个吐错误的黑盒，而能在符号、重定位、段布局这些层面上，精确推断出一个二进制文件为什么能跑、或者为什么不能。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"compilation-pipeline","title":"从源码到运行：编译、链接与装载全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/foundations/compilation-pipeline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"object-files","title":"目标文件格式：ELF、PE 与 Mach-O","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/foundations/object-files"},{"seq":3,"slug":"symbols-relocation","title":"符号与重定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/foundations/symbols-relocation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"linking","title":"链接","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/linking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"static-linking","title":"静态链接与静态库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/linking/static-linking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"symbol-resolution","title":"符号解析与库顺序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/linking/symbol-resolution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sections-segments","title":"节、段与内存布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/linking/sections-segments"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"dynamic","title":"动态链接","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/dynamic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"shared-libraries","title":"共享库与动态链接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/dynamic/shared-libraries"},{"seq":2,"slug":"plt-got","title":"PLT/GOT 与延迟绑定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/dynamic/plt-got"},{"seq":3,"slug":"loading-runtime","title":"运行期加载与 dlopen","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/dynamic/loading-runtime"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced","title":"进阶","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lto-optimization","title":"链接时优化 LTO","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/advanced/lto-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"position-independent","title":"位置无关代码与 ASLR","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/advanced/position-independent"},{"seq":3,"slug":"debugging-linking","title":"链接问题排查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/linkers-loaders/advanced/debugging-linking"}]}]}